# ============================================================

# K3 — Intelligent Assistant System

# .gitignore

#

# Purpose:

# Prevent local, temporary, generated, sensitive and

# environment-specific files from being committed.

#

# Important:

# NEVER commit API keys, passwords, tokens, credentials,

# private keys, .env files, local databases, user data,

# model weights, runtime state or private logs.

#

# This file is intentionally comprehensive and supports:

#

# AI Engine

# Memory

# Tools

# Agents

# API

# Database

# Vector Storage

# Evaluation

# Frontend

# Docker

# Cloud

# Testing

# Development

#

